@startuml
title Expense Track - Signup and Login Sequence

actor Member
boundary "Web Browser" as Browser
control "Django Views / LoginView" as Views
control "SignupForm / AuthenticationForm" as Forms
database "PostgreSQL\n(Django auth + expenses)" as Database

== Create account ==
Member -> Browser: Open /signup/ and submit details
Browser -> Views: POST /signup/\nusername, email, password
Views -> Forms: Validate SignupForm
Forms -> Database: Check username and email availability
Database --> Forms: No existing account
Forms --> Views: Valid form
Views -> Database: Insert auth_user\n(hashed password)
Views -> Database: Create login session
Views --> Browser: Redirect /dashboard/
Browser --> Member: Personal dashboard

== Login with username or email ==
Member -> Browser: Submit identity and password
Browser -> Views: POST /login/
Views -> Forms: Validate EmailOrUsernameAuthenticationForm
alt Identity is an email
  Forms -> Database: Find active user by email
  Database --> Forms: Username for matching account
end
Forms -> Database: Verify Django password hash
Database --> Forms: Authenticated user
Forms --> Views: Valid login
Views -> Database: Create/update login session
Views --> Browser: Redirect /dashboard/
Browser --> Member: Own transactions, budget and goals only

@enduml
